  <text x="606" y="84" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1d21">实测（40 万请求）</text>
  <text x="606" y="108" font-size="11" fill="#3d454e">λ=2500　Wq 0.01ms　p99 0.5ms</text>
  <text x="606" y="130" font-size="11" fill="#3d454e">λ=4000　Wq 0.39ms　p99 3.4ms</text>
  <text x="606" y="152" font-size="11" fill="#3d454e">λ=4500　Wq 1.35ms　p99 9.0ms</text>
  <text x="606" y="174" font-size="11" fill="#3d454e">λ=4800　Wq 4.01ms　p99 21.2ms</text>
